msgid "Che cosa vuoi dire"
msgstr "Какво искаш да кажеш"

#. The hint under the writing box: Enter says the sentence, Esc stops the voice, ↑ brings back the last sentence. Keys named as on the keyboard of the language.
#: crates/app/ui/kalliope/scrittura.slint
#, kalliope-slint
msgctxt "programma.scrittura.invio-dice-esc-ferma"
msgid "Invio la dice · Esc la ferma · ↑ l'ultima frase"
msgstr "Enter — говори · Esc — спри · ↑ — последна фраза"

#. The hint under the writing box in a smaller window: Enter says the sentence, Esc stops the voice.
#: crates/app/ui/kalliope/scrittura.slint
#, kalliope-slint
